# Example ReRDMFT input file: LiH, X2C spinors, GNOF (two coupling
# subspaces), FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE (PNOF counterpart of
# water_X2C_full_optimization.inp). The orbital-rotation energy uses the full
# two-RDM path, valid for any (also non-symmetric) orbitals.
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
X2C TRUE
FUNCTIONAL GNOF
PNOF_SUBSPACES 2
PNOF_COUPLING 2
FULL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE
MACRO_ENERGY_TOLERANCE 1e-10

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   5.000000
END
